# The night-lights texture, copied out of node_modules by
# scripts/copy-textures.mjs. Kept out of git so a 700 KB binary does not live in
# history; it arrives with npm install and is copied before dev and build. It
# was five files until the globe renderer was deleted (D104) -- the other four
# lit a three.js sphere that no longer exists.
frontend/public/textures/

# Session handoff notes. Local working state that tracks in-progress status and
# open bugs, not a committed artifact — it goes stale the moment it is shared.
HANDOFF.md

# ICAO airline designators, reduced out of node_modules by
# scripts/build-airlines.mjs. Generated, for the same reason.
frontend/public/data/

# Orbital elements cached between runs, so a restart during an upstream
# outage still has something to propagate. Derived data with a network source.
backend/.cache/
